project from the beginning

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.920
and is taking the center
in amazing directions.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.910
Sandra Malan-Bowles who
coordinates it from the Whitney.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.440
Leana Hirschfeld-Kroen who did all

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:48.310
